      "number": "940",
      "source_number": "940",
      "group": "第34小节",
      "group_id": "g5",
      "text": "940. 下列命题哪些是真命题（字母$x_1$和$x_2$表示两个数）？\nа) $(x_2>x_1)\\Longrightarrow(5x_2>5x_1)$；\nб) $(x_2>x_1)\\Longrightarrow(-8x_2>-8x_1)$；\nв) $(x_2>x_1)\\Longrightarrow(x_2^3>x_1^3)$；\nг) $(x_2>x_1>0)\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\frac{1}{x_2}>\\frac{1}{x_1}\\right)$；\nд) $(x_2>x_1>0)\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\frac{1}{x_2}<\\frac{1}{x_1}\\right)$；\nе) $(x_2>x_1>0)\\Longrightarrow(x_2^2>x_1^2)$。",
      "lines": [
        "940. 下列命题哪些是真命题（字母$x_1$和$x_2$表示两个数）？",
        "а) $(x_2>x_1)\\Longrightarrow(5x_2>5x_1)$；",
        "б) $(x_2>x_1)\\Longrightarrow(-8x_2>-8x_1)$；",
        "в) $(x_2>x_1)\\Longrightarrow(x_2^3>x_1^3)$；",
        "г) $(x_2>x_1>0)\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\frac{1}{x_2}>\\frac{1}{x_1}\\right)$；",
        "д) $(x_2>x_1>0)\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\frac{1}{x_2}<\\frac{1}{x_1}\\right)$；",
        "е) $(x_2>x_1>0)\\Longrightarrow(x_2^2>x_1^2)$。"
      ],
      "pages": [
        "p0287#9",
        "p0288#1"
      ],
      "figure_refs": [],
      "figures": [],
      "source_text": "940. 下列命题哪些是真命题（字母$x_1$和$x_2$表示两个数）？а) $(x_2>x_1)\\Longrightarrow(5x_2>5x_1)$；б) $(x_2>x_1)\\Longrightarrow(-8x_2>-8x_1)$；в) $(x_2>x_1)\\Longrightarrow(x_2^3>x_1^3)$；г) $(x_2>x_1>0)\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\frac{1}{x_2}>\\frac{1}{x_1}\\right)$；д) $(x_2>x_1>0)\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\frac{1}{x_2}<\\frac{1}{x_1}\\right)$；е) $(x_2>x_1>0)\\Longrightarrow(x_2^2>x_1^2)$。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "number": "941",
      "source_number": "941",
      "group": "第34小节",
      "group_id": "g5",
      "text": "941. 已知：1) 函数$f$和$g$的定义域都是集合$M$；2) $f$是增函数；3) $g$是减函数；4) $a\\in M,b\\in M$。说明下列命题是否真命题：а) $(f(a)>f(b))\\Longrightarrow(a>b)$；б) $(g(a)>g(b))\\Longrightarrow(a<b)$；в) $(f(a)<f(b))\\Longrightarrow(a<b)$；г) $(g(a)<g(b))\\Longrightarrow(a<b)$；д) $(a\\ne b)\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\frac{f(a)-f(b)}{a-b}>0\\right)$；е) $(a\\ne b)\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\frac{g(a)-g(b)}{a-b}<0\\right)$。",
