      "text": "1015. 解方程：\nа) $\\frac{y}{y^2-9}-\\frac{1}{y^2+3y}+\\frac{3}{6y+2y^2}=0$；\nб) $\\frac{y-1}{14y^2+7y}+\\frac{8}{12y^2-3}=\\frac{2y+1}{6y^2-3y}$；\nв) $\\frac{3}{x^2-9}-\\frac{1}{9-6x+x^2}=\\frac{3}{2x^2+6x}$。",
