          "number": "941",
          "source_number": "941",
          "group": "第34小节",
          "group_id": "g5",
          "text": "941. 已知：1) 函数$f$和$g$的定义域都是集合$M$；2) $f$是增函数；3) $g$是减函数；4) $a\\in M,b\\in M$。说明下列命题是否真命题：а) $(f(a)>f(b))\\Longrightarrow(a>b)$；б) $(g(a)>g(b))\\Longrightarrow(a<b)$；в) $(f(a)<f(b))\\Longrightarrow(a<b)$；г) $(g(a)<g(b))\\Longrightarrow(a<b)$；д) $(a\\ne b)\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\frac{f(a)-f(b)}{a-b}>0\\right)$；е) $(a\\ne b)\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\frac{g(a)-g(b)}{a-b}<0\\right)$。",
          "lines": [
            "941. 已知：1) 函数$f$和$g$的定义域都是集合$M$；2) $f$是",
            "增函数；3) $g$是减函数；4) $a\\in M,b\\in M$。说明下列命",
            "题是否真命题：",
            "а) $(f(a)>f(b))\\Longrightarrow(a>b)$；",
            "б) $(g(a)>g(b))\\Longrightarrow(a<b)$；",
            "в) $(f(a)<f(b))\\Longrightarrow(a<b)$；",
            "г) $(g(a)<g(b))\\Longrightarrow(a<b)$；",
            "д) $(a\\ne b)\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\frac{f(a)-f(b)}{a-b}>0\\right)$；",
            "е) $(a\\ne b)\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\frac{g(a)-g(b)}{a-b}<0\\right)$。"
          ],
          "pages": [
            "p0288#2"
          ],
          "figure_refs": [],
          "figures": []
        },
